      "id": "claim_40ea18ba85894e7d90e74ffcb46b42ca",
      "statement": "The supervised ControlNet injects per-block residuals into the frozen base UNet via MONAI's native down_block_additional_residuals / mid_block_additional_residual forward args (ADR-0026); the MONAI backbone's in-place += on those tensors breaks any grad-flow back from the base to the ControlNet, so the base's residual forward is wrapped to perform the residual add out-of-place (ADR-0026's corrected hazard); x_src is a control signal (ControlNet condition), not a transport endpoint — the transport is the canonical noise→data rectified flow shared with unconditional JiT (ADR-0027).",
